WEBVTT

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:04.040
I finally also...

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.130
Where are you?

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.200
Sunrise has already long passed!

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:12.780
I'm here.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.430
Show yourself.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.180
I know you have a laser gun.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.210
I have no desire to be called out
just so you can target me.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:25.000
She's pretty with it for a kid.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.890
What about the Gyrostabilizer?

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.430
It's here.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.280
Hand it over!

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.090
After you release Howard!

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.260
Quit your babbling!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.930
How about I kill him first?

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:54.480
Then I'll break the Gyrostabilizer.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.090
What?

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.040
Bob, calm down.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.040
I can't tell who's a bigger brat.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:14.390
Leave the laser gun and
the electric whip where you are.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.190
When you do, I'll show myself.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:18.480
Very well.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.940
Brindo!

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:23.240
Don't worry. These aren't our only weapons.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:30.700
We've put them down.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.700
I'm not safe yet. Step forward away from them.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.180
She's getting on my nerves!

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.710
This is interesting. Do we just follow their plan?

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:46.150
We'll just kill them all anyways.
We might as well play their game in the meantime.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.910
That's enough, right? Show yourself!

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.060
Menori!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.430
Send Howard this way.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.490
What about the Gyrostabilizer?

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:10.530
Right here.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.290
Is it real?

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.200
I can't tell from here.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.140
Don't move!

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.130
If you move, I'll throw it in the river.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.410
Fine.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:24.510
What do we do?

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:26.990
We're in trouble if the river carries it away.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.790
Cover me.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.260
I'll grab my gun and kill them.

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:45.780
Bastard!

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:47.280
Where'd he come from?

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:52.150
Howard! Dive into the river!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.480
Damn you brats!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.110
I won't let you escape!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.590
Hurry!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.430
Take this!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.330
Luna!

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.530
Fetch!

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:30.180
Have a painful death!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.530
Got it!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.430
Brindo! What are you doing?

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:58.110
Luna! Snap out of it!

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:07.710
Are you idiots?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.530
You're well within range.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.310
It's a fake!

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.450
They played us for fools!

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:17.430
Brindo...

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:21.480
...why don't you teach these brats what real fear is?

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.560
Yeah.

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:25.600
Maybe they'll be more honest afterwards.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:44.050
Luna...

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.580
Luna!

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:53.990
Adam!

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.990
What is this thing?

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.630
Help me!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:23.840
Now's our chance!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.240
I won't let you escape!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.140
Think you can make a fool of me?

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.160
Nano-plants?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.700
This planet's doing everything it can to entertain us.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.840
I'm fine now.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.200
Thanks, Kaoru.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.080
I'll come back after checking on their movements.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.690
You go on ahead.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:16.750
Okay.

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.100
We're counting on you.

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.080
Luna!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.510
How's Howard?

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:46.860
Anyways, let's get inside!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.650
When we find them,
I'll put them out of our misery!

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:54.140
Don't kill them right away. It would be less fun.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:08:59.350
That's odd.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.080
Another dead end.

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.110
This is the same place we just were!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.260
Are you sure they came this way?

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:08.500
Unmistakably.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.380
Then why aren't they here?

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.110
Let's look back the way we came.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.160
How are the space ship repairs?

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:42.660
Shingo and such are working on them,
but they don't seem to be going well.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.160
Welcome back.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.360
Where are they?

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:58.040
Being deceived by the illusionary forest.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.930
But we don't know when they'll sniff this place out.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:03.440
We'll have to keep a lookout tonight.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.610
Very well. We'll do it.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:07.830
How's Howard?

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.130
He's not well.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.030
He's sweating terribly.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.000
His fever is high too.

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:22.450
So there was poison in that needle after all.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:30.480
What's wrong? You all have such serious faces.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:34.000
Howard was shot by Zilba's poison needle gun.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.930
What? Why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.000
Have him take this.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.850
It's a medicine which works as an antidote.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:47.130
It should have some effect
against the poison Zilba uses.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.740
Howard? This is medicine. Swallow it.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.680
Good. Here's some water.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.030
The rest depends on his vitality.

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:42.850
It hurts...

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.980
It hurts!

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:53.160
What's happened to my body?

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:57.700
It's hopeless. I'm done for!

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:04.300
What?

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.890
It's the colony.

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.090
Huh?

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:30.060
Did I get back to the colony?

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:40.190
Today we're going to visit my house. We'll meet in front of the school gates after class.

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.810
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:48.290
Back then I had lots of followers
who'd do what I said.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.510
Even Bell was my follower.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:55.000
But what I wanted most...

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.240
You guys should at least wash your own shoes.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:04.980
That's right. It's all because
she interfered that things got weird.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.010
Damn you!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:17.990
Before then there'd been nobody
who'd dared to stand up to me.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.800
You can't get on that!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:27.510
That ship's going to run into a gravity storm!

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:34.940
It's that escape shuttle's fault!

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.900
Because of that, we...

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.150
It seems like just ocean.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.510
The wind feels nice!

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.050
It's true!

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:14.500
That's right... that day my life on this planet began.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:20.910
No house, no TV, and no soft bed.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.640
No candy or soft drinks or air conditioning.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:37.260
All there was was hot sunlight, shady forests, and creepy insects, and monstrous plants and animals.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:38.800
Don't interfere!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.250
And on top of that, a group
who just get mad all the time.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.400
Stop grumbling and walk faster!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.750
I know!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.990
Help me!

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:56.310
Idiot!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.950
Guys giving me orders as though
they were so important.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:03.960
Guys embarrassing me all the time.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:07.600
And among them, even Bell!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.900
This one's way better! I'm saved!

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.000
Use it carefully.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:22.680
Who do you think you're
looking at when you say that?

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.010
Bell! How dare you do this to me!

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:27.590
Don't think this is over!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:30.550
I'll tell my papa, and your dad'll be fired!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.610
Our parents have nothing to do with it!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.750
This is our problem!

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.110
I haven't eaten in two days.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.190
Ever since coming to this island...

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:46.900
...people have just been mad at me.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:52.680
I should be good at hunting and fishing, but I can't do them well.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:57.030
Are you seriously telling me to work in the field?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:03.180
Son of the head of the Howard Group,
I, the great Howard Junior?

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.240
I was searching for food.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.760
Come to think of it, all I've
been doing is looking for food.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:12.330
Once breakfast is done, looking for lunch...

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:16.110
...once lunch is done, looking for dinner...

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.590
...again and again, every day.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:23.610
I'm sick of it! I'm sick of this lifestyle!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:30.510
That's why back then, I thought I could
really say farewell to this lifestyle.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.430
Naive kid, aren't you?

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:33.630
Are you sure?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:35.130
There's no doubt.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.190
But they...

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:56.690
I guess this is what youed call having your life flash before your eyes...

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.960
...but am I going to die just like this?

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:06.510
Everyone's probably mad at me for acting selfishly.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.980
Even though they all opposed me all the time...

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:18.210
...my friends from the academy wouldn't have
put their lives on the line to save me.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:22.150
Luna!

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:25.750
That's what you call real friends.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:31.710
I finally also have real friends.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.930
No!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.800
Welcome back, Howard.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.430
I'm home.

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:14.690
No!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.440
I'd finally made real friends...

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:22.560
I don't want to die! I don't want to die yet!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:25.790
Help me!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.000
Howard!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.790
Howard's come to!

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.050
Really?

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:49.790
Howard!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.980
His fever's gone down too.

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:03.550
That's a relief.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.460
It really is a relief.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.190
Thank goodness.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.080
Talk about havin' bad luck!

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.610
It's true!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:12.700
Howard!

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.650
The medicine worked?

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:16.940
Nothing to worry about.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.540
Aren't you angry?

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.600
I betrayed everyone and...

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:28.940
I...

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.200
You did it for everyone's sake, right?

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:36.550
It wasn't good of you to act independently...

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.590
...but you did it with everyone in mind.

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:41.650
It can't be helped.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.460
You're wrong! I...

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.990
I tried to save just myself...

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.060
Forget about it.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.200
You'll... forgive me?

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:03.330
Of course!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.950
Once you clean the bathroom for a week.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:14.650
I... I've been hiding something from you all.

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:22.450
Up until now, I didn't have the courage to say it.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.950
When the ship ran into the gravity storm during the school trip...

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:38.540
Only our escape shuttle was detached, right?

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.050
That's...

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:42.740
That's...

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.780
...my fault!

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.200
Back then...

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:59.310
Ten seconds until warp.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:00.960
9...

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:02.650
8...

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:09.660
In the confusion, I accidentally pressed the release switch!

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.050
But...

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:14.540
But I was too afraid to tell everyone!

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:28.300
It's my fault!

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:32.800
All of this happening is my...

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.410
Well said.

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:46.600
It must have been hard.

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:51.360
It must have hurt thinking
about how you were responsible.

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:56.650
I...

00:21:57.030 --> 00:21:57.740
Howard...

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:00.700
From now on...

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.600
...let's work together more than we have until now.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:09.180
We'll fight our way out of this corner together.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.000
Luna...

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:15.780
You bet!

00:22:16.110 --> 00:22:17.760
Just like Luna said!

00:22:20.390 --> 00:22:21.780
Let's work together, Howard.

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:23.650
Like we'd let those guys beat us!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:25.000
I'll try hard too!

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.310
All of us will together.

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:27.330
Yeah.

00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:32.280
I'll cooperate too.

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.110
Everyone...

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:05.730
Somehow it seems like we can
fix the gravity control unit.

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:07.230
Really?

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:10.150
Yeah, but it might take a while.

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:11.010
I see.

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:15.810
Until then, we'd better make sure
those three don't find the ruins.

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:18.740
The illusionary forest will buy us some time...

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:19.830
Huh?

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:21.510
Where'd Adam go?

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:24.400
I'm worried! I'll go look for him.

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:28.190
Next time: What should I do?
